            "review_text": "Jeff L\n2 contributions\n0\nBest Bar in Vietnam\nDec 2022 • Solo\nPub Viet is the kind of place you visit to feel like you're home in Hanoi. The owner is always present and very friendly, and the staff is top notch. In addition, this place draws a great crowd of regulars from ex-pats to locals, all of whom are incredibly welcoming. I've loved so much about Vietnam, but my memories from this place will stand out the most when I think of this visit.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 25, 2022",
